## Status convention

Each theme page tracks status as one of: **Not started · In progress · Complete · Blocked**. A theme is "Complete" only when its checkpoint is satisfied AND verified by a Reviewer agent.

## Mapping to requirements

Themes derive from canonical requirements (location to be set per project — e.g., `requirements/user-needs.yaml` or a Confluence page or a customer doc). Each theme page lists which requirement IDs it satisfies. Tickets in {{TRACKER_TYPE}} carry the same labels.
